<title>FINLAND: RESEARCH ALERT-VALMET MKT PERFORMER-GOLDMAN.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-VALMET MKT PERFORMER-GOLDMAN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs retained its &quot;market performer&quot; rating for Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy and suggested switching into engineering group Rauma Oy .</p>
<p>In a reseach note dated February 27 and received on Friday, Goldman said: &quot;We retain our neutral to negatively biased stance on Valmet shares following 1996 full-year results broadly in line with expectations.&quot;</p>
<p>Goldman Sachs forecast Valmet's earnings per share to fall to 9.6 markka in 1997 and to 8.2 markka in 1998 from 10.1 in 1996. It set a 105 markka 12-month price target for Valmet.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
